oc=AdlZWa_JI_6hawTaIFYto8T9t_B3w3TLH0zOyZ9G7TED9bCcAojjtKiVwjRgWKeK4dg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsq1KatQ9GoshnW_c74Z9fTm_VIBT_qux4Q6aNEmduVAA&oe=699848F3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rocL52y9POcQ7kNvwFZ2WbE&_nc_oc=AdlL66chylLxHnsRGkd5_5it0WBLbfOO5SJrJxQZGLvjYvldjK8dsf8JzqRqAVtN9dM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftgMc8DHar5l5qKUH4NS6mtFFSJpb-iR1xunI1geqm0mQ&oe=699847EF"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", 